# 🚗 Atellas Fleet — Complete Project Analysis & Feature Pitch

> **Product Category:** SaaS Fleet Management & Car Rental Platform  
> **Target Market:** Moroccan car rental agencies (B2B & B2C)  
> **Tech Stack:** React 18 + TypeScript / Laravel 12 + PHP 8.3 / MySQL 8 / Docker  
> **Analysis Date:** April 25, 2026

---

## 📊 Project Overview

**Atellas Fleet** is a full-stack, production-ready **car rental and fleet management platform** designed specifically for the Moroccan market. It combines a polished, consumer-facing booking experience with a powerful back-office admin dashboard — all packaged in a self-hosted, Dockerized architecture.

### Architecture Summary

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Client["🌐 Client Browser"]
        ReactSPA["React 18 SPA<br/>TypeScript + TailwindCSS"]
        OCR["Tesseract.js OCR<br/>(In-Browser)"]
        Gemini["Google Gemini<br/>AI Assistant"]
    end

    subgraph Docker["🐳 Docker Compose"]
        Nginx["Nginx Reverse Proxy<br/>SSL/TLS Ready"]
        Laravel["Laravel 12 API<br/>PHP-FPM 8.3"]
        MySQL["MySQL 8<br/>Persistent Volume"]
        Redis["Redis 7<br/>Cache + Sessions + Queues"]
        Adminer["Adminer<br/>DB Web UI"]
    end

    ReactSPA -->|"HTTPS /api/*"| Nginx
    Nginx -->|"FastCGI :9000"| Laravel
    Laravel --> MySQL
    Laravel --> Redis
    Adminer --> MySQL
    OCR -.->|"Client-side"| ReactSPA
    Gemini -.->|"Gemini API"| ReactSPA
```

### Scale & Complexity

| Metric | Count |
|---|---|
| **Frontend Components** | 60+ React components across 8 modules |
| **Backend API Controllers** | 18 RESTful controllers |
| **Database Migrations** | 42 versioned migrations |
| **Eloquent Models** | 16 data models |
| **API Endpoints** | 85+ REST endpoints |
| **Frontend Services** | 15+ API client modules |
| **Lines of Code (approx.)** | ~25,000+ (frontend) + ~15,000+ (backend) |

