## 🎯 Key Product Features for Client Pitching

### 1. 🧙‍♂️ AI-Powered Fleet Assistant (Powered by Google Gemini)

> **Pitch:** *"Your customers never browse alone — an AI concierge recommends the perfect vehicle."*

- Built-in AI chatbot branded **"Aero"** powered by Google Gemini 1.5 Flash
- Automatically understands the entire fleet catalog (prices, features, fuel types)
- Responds in French, with a luxury-tech tone
- Guides customers from inquiry to booking in natural conversation
- **Differentiator:** No other Moroccan rental platform offers embedded AI assistance

---

### 2. 📄 Smart KYC with Document OCR Scanner

> **Pitch:** *"Verify client identity in seconds — scan CIN & driver's license with a phone camera."*

- **Dual OCR Engine:**
  - **Client-side:** Tesseract.js runs entirely in-browser (zero API cost, works offline)
  - **Server-side:** Google Cloud Vision API for high-accuracy extraction
- Supports **Moroccan CNIE** (new format without labels) and **driver's licenses**
- Parses **MRZ zones** (ICAO TD1 standard) for machine-readable ID cards
- Multi-strategy extraction: MRZ → Label-based → Structural analysis → Word-level scan
- Handles OCR error correction (0→O, 1→I, 8→B, 5→S)
- Extracts: First name, Last name, CIN number, Driver's license number
- **Client Value:** Eliminates manual data entry, reduces fraud, speeds up booking by 70%

---

### 3. 📅 Live Availability Calendar with Smart Conflict Detection

> **Pitch:** *"Real-time vehicle availability at a glance — no double-bookings, guaranteed."*

- Interactive 3-month availability grid per vehicle
- Color-coded status: ✅ Available / 🔴 Booked / 🟡 Partial
- **Multi-unit vehicle tracking** (e.g., 4× Dacia Sandero tracked by license plate)
- Automatic conflict detection with **422 response + next available slot suggestion**
- Backend calculates `remainingUnits()` in real-time across overlapping date ranges
- **Client Value:** Maximizes fleet utilization, prevents overbooking losses

---

### 4. 🗺️ Interactive Gantt Chart Booking Planner

> **Pitch:** *"Manage every booking on every vehicle from a single, visual timeline."*

- Full-width Gantt chart view per vehicle with unit-level rows
- Drag-to-view bookings across weeks/months
- Status-coded booking blocks (Pending, Confirmed, Active, Completed, Cancelled)
- Quick-edit bookings directly from the Gantt view
- **Client Value:** Operations managers see the entire fleet at a glance

---

### 5. 🚀 Multi-Step Booking Wizard (4-Step Flow)

> **Pitch:** *"A seamless booking experience that converts visitors into customers."*

| Step | Feature |
|---|---|
| **Step 1** | Vehicle selection with live availability calendar |
| **Step 2** | Identity verification via document scanner (CIN/license OCR) |
| **Step 3** | Cost calculation with tax, deposit, and insurance breakdown |
| **Step 4** | Booking finalization with GPS pickup coordinates + confirmation email |

- GPS pickup locator using Browser Geolocation API
- 6 Moroccan airports pre-seeded as pickup/dropoff points
- Automatic cost breakdown: daily rate × days + tax + security deposit
- Post-booking tracking page with unique access key

---

### 6. 📊 Comprehensive Admin Dashboard (17 Modules)

> **Pitch:** *"Everything you need to run a rental agency — in one dashboard."*

| Module | Capabilities |
|---|---|
| **📈 Analytics** | Revenue charts, active rentals, pending requests |
| **🚗 Fleet** | Add/edit/delete vehicles, specs, documents, GPS coordinates |
| **📋 Bookings** | Full CRUD + Gantt view + status management |
| **👥 Clients** | KYC dossiers, document history, VIP/Blacklist status |
| **📝 Contracts** | Generate PDF rental contracts from bookings |
| **💰 Invoices** | Auto-generate from contracts, mark paid, download PDF |
| **💸 Expenses** | Track fuel, maintenance, insurance costs with summaries |
| **⚠️ Infractions** | Log speeding fines, parking violations against bookings |
| **🔧 Maintenance** | Schedule oil changes, tire rotations, brake services |
| **📍 Pickup Points** | Manage branches & airports (pickup/dropoff/both) |
| **⭐ Reviews** | Moderate client reviews (publish/hide) |
| **📰 Blog/CMS** | Publish articles with categories and images |
| **💬 Messages** | Client support inbox with reply + read/unread toggle |
| **⚙️ Settings** | Tax rates, deposit rates, company info, notification emails |
| **👤 Profiles** | User profile management with password change |
| **🎮 Demo Accounts** | Create time-limited trial accounts with granular tab permissions |
| **📊 Tracking** | Real-time GPS position tracking per vehicle |

---

### 7. 🎮 Demo Account System (SaaS Trial Engine)

> **Pitch:** *"Let prospects test the platform before committing — without risk."*

- Create time-limited demo accounts for prospective clients
- **Granular permission control:** choose which admin tabs each demo user can access
- Auto-expiry with countdown timer
- Resend credentials email with one click
- Extend trial duration dynamically
- Complete tenant isolation — each demo account has its own data sandbox
- **Client Value:** Shortens sales cycle from weeks to hours

---

### 8. 📑 Contract & Invoice Generation

> **Pitch:** *"Professional PDF contracts and invoices generated in one click."*

- Auto-generate rental contracts from bookings with all client/vehicle data pre-filled
- Detailed contract fields: mileage start/end, fuel level, condition notes, signatures
- Invoice generation linked to contracts
- Payment tracking: Paid / Deposit Only / Unpaid
- Payment method recording (cash, card, transfer)
- Currency support (MAD default)
- **Client Value:** Eliminates paper-based contract workflows

---

### 9. 🔒 Enterprise-Grade Security

> **Pitch:** *"Bank-level security with role-based access control."*

- **Laravel Sanctum** SPA token authentication
- Role-based access: Client / Admin / Demo Admin
- Rate-limited auth endpoints (5 requests/minute)
- CORS protection with strict origin policies
- SSL/TLS ready with auto-generated self-signed certificates
- Redis-backed sessions for scalable multi-instance deployments

---

### 10. 🇲🇦 Built for Morocco

> **Pitch:** *"Designed from the ground up for Moroccan rental agencies."*

- 🇫🇷 **Full French localization** — all UI text, error messages, and AI responses in French
- 🪪 **Moroccan CIN recognition** — CNIE format with Arabic/French hybrid parsing
- 🏛️ **Moroccan document compliance** — insurance, visite technique, vignette, carte grise tracking with expiry alerts
- ✈️ **Moroccan airports** — 6 airports pre-seeded (Rabat-Salé, etc.)
- 📍 **Moroccan geography** — Leaflet + OpenStreetMap integration centered on Rabat
- 🚗 **Local fleet catalog** — Dacia Logan, Sandero, Duster, Peugeot, Renault, Citroën, Hyundai, Kia
- 💰 **MAD pricing** — Moroccan Dirham native currency support

