## 🏗️ Technical Architecture Strengths (For Technical Buyers)

| Strength | Details |
|---|---|
| **One-Command Deployment** | `docker compose up -d --build` spins up the entire stack |
| **6 Docker Services** | Nginx, Laravel, React, MySQL, Redis, Adminer |
| **Production-Ready** | Render.yaml + Vercel configs included for cloud deployment |
| **Scalable Backend** | Redis caching, queue workers via Supervisor, MySQL indexing |
| **Tenant Isolation** | `BelongsToDemoTenant` trait scopes all data per demo account |
| **Modern Frontend** | React 19, TypeScript strict, Framer Motion animations |
| **18 API Controllers** | Full REST API with validation, authorization, and error handling |
| **42 Database Migrations** | Versioned schema evolution with zero-downtime updates |
| **Comprehensive API** | 85+ endpoints covering every business operation |
| **Map Integration** | Leaflet.js + OpenStreetMap for GPS tracking and pickup locations |

